<title>USA: U.S. Filter files to offer stock, notes.</title>
<headline>U.S. Filter files to offer stock, notes.</headline>
<dateline>PALM DESERT, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>United States Filter Corp said Thursday it has filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register proposed offerings of 10 million common shares and $175 million principal amount of Convertible Subordinated Notes due 2001.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds of the offerings will be used to fund or repay debt used to fund the acquisitions of the Water Systems and Manufacturing Group of Wheelabrator Technologies Inc and the Process Equipment Division of United Utilities Plc. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
